t is delivered a second time\". A send is delivered exactly once, so the check refuses only histories that are already inconsistent. It leaves the 3bf7e5aa copy requirement for a first delivery, the 1cf42f3b genesis-copy admission and the 5a642337 anchor kinds unchanged. With the patch, replay passes 156/156 and verify.test 8/8.\nI still recommend (b) for both, with the b89e7f84 window stated in the note. With both patches, cli is expected to pass 291/291. I have not run the combination yet."}